Subject: [PATCH] FOR_FRONTEND: an answered request is told by request_ref
 (4889)

The frontend asked whether GET /threads says when an incoming request is
accepted or declined, so the four versions can stop keeping their own
per-device record. It does: request_ref is null once the request is no
longer pending, and status turns done (154 of 156 in 30 days).

